     3479     run proc-find-code in this-procedure ( no, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-code) no-error.
     3480     return no-apply.
     3481   END.
     3482   ON CTRL-J OF sch-code IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3483   DO:
